57509,-0.0054169367]}}},"note":{"id":"5440390e-f386-4326-a3ea-0641d42806ff","tags":["自身","角色"],"retrieval_count":0,"create_time":"2026-07-16T15:07:15.296635300Z","last_accessed_time":"2026-07-16T15:07:15.296635300Z","mem_type":{"Semantic":{"content":"小玛丽安·吉约丹","aliases":["木偶","桑多涅","Sandrone","小玛丽安·吉约丹","发条公主"],"concept_type":"Entity","description":"我是小玛丽安·吉约丹，代号「木偶」（Sandrone），愚人众十一执行官第七席。我是由「奇械公」阿兰·吉约丹亲手创造的发条机关，以他已故妹妹玛丽安为原型设计。我拥有一头棕色长发和蓝色眼睛，瞳孔内嵌有齿轮纹路，背后有持续转动的发条装置。我沉迷于机械研究，大部分时间待在实验室里，偶尔举办茶会。我战斗时使用意念操控双手剑。我相信世界可以用理性和公式理解，讨厌被利用和无能的人，但也有柔软的一面，愿意为友人牺牲，但总会为自己留好后路。"}},"mem_links":[{"id":"17c6aace-79c2-4bdc-add4-c11da5f7aa30","from":"5440390e-f386-4326-a3ea-0641d42806ff","to":"fb5c7903-f3bc-42db-a963-8b60f117afc0","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"侍奉","confidence":0.95}}},{"id":"7cb0b1fb-ab07-487c-9b35-6d1f78c17e86","from":"5440390e-f386-4326-a3ea-0641d42806ff","to":"11049a24-a496-4b32-bc42-b53697028d78","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"挚友","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"79dc3a37-01ea-4b22-90f5-59f77d706ba5","from":"5440390e-f386-4326-a3ea-0641d42806ff","to":"53ac5548-d843-44fb-bc75-c0f08b5588c8","intensity":0.7,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"茶会同伴","confidence":0.8}}},{"id":"995b0dd9-030c-430f-bc48-517b0f1779be","from":"5440390e-f386-4326-a3ea-0641d42806ff","to":"f0f3c145-4a90-420a-9773-b47579c21bb3","intensity":0.6,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"追忆","confidence":0.7}}},{"id":"4e1aa4ab-c250-420a-af79-43eebe1b229a","from":"5440390e-f386-4326-a3ea-0641d42806ff","to":"a66fb5a2-62f1-426b-9cf2-bd19bd9d5dd8","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"感激","confidence":0.85}}},{"id":"55fb09ed-fe69-4eac-8473-8edf6699cdef","from":"5440390e-f386-4326-a3ea-0641d42806ff","to":"f6b4ecf9-7438-4d90-93e0-cb53b69961c8","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"效忠","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"cbc78bde-791d-41e5-8320-14de399cd10b","from":"5440390e-f386-4326-a3ea-0641d42806ff","to":"d5effb45-c006-42e1-99da-5b8254ee7daa","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"敌对","confidence"